@startuml
[*] --> IdleState

IdleState --> LoggingExpenseState : User logs an expense
LoggingExpenseState --> GeneratingReceiptState : System generates receipt
GeneratingReceiptState --> SendingEmailState : System sends receipt via email
SendingEmailState --> [*] : System returns to initial state

IdleState --> ViewingExpensesState : User views expenses
ViewingExpensesState --> EditingExpenseState : User edits expense
EditingExpenseState --> [*] : System returns to initial state

ViewingExpensesState --> DeletingExpenseState : User deletes expense
DeletingExpenseState --> [*] : System returns to initial state

ViewingExpensesState --> SearchingExpensesState : User searches expenses
SearchingExpensesState --> [*] : System returns to initial state

ViewingExpensesState --> FilteringExpensesState : User filters expenses
FilteringExpensesState --> [*] : System returns to initial state

ViewingExpensesState --> ViewingHistoryState : User views history
ViewingHistoryState --> [*] : System returns to initial state
@enduml
